urlparse
------------------------------------------
urlparse is a URL parser compatible to url_parser_parse_url() from
nodejs/http-parser which has been archived since 2022. urlparse only implements
the strict mode.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  liburlparse-devel-0.0.0+git20260912-1bl1
  liburlparse0-0.0.0+git20260912-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.11-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.13-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/ngtcp2/urlparse

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/ngtcp2/urlparse.git

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack urlparse-0.0.0+git20260912-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./urlparse-0.0.0+git20260912-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/urlparse-0.0.0+git20260912-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/urlparse-0.0.0+git20260912-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/liburlparse0-0.0.0+git20260912-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/liburlparse-devel-0.0.0+git20260912-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(urlparse)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/urlparse.README
  /usr/share/doc/urlparse/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/urlparse/README

(liburlparse0)
  /usr/bin/cygurlparse-0.dll

(liburlparse-devel)
  /usr/include/urlparse.h
  /usr/lib/liburlparse.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/urlparse.pc

